{"title":"标准化试卷标记语言","comparisons":{"blog-cn_2013_04_14_standard-exam-language_20130418.html":{"from":"blog-cn_2013_04_14_standard-exam-language_20090101.html","to":"blog-cn_2013_04_14_standard-exam-language_20130418.html","from_date":"2009-01-01","to_date":"2013-04-18","counts":{"added":4,"removed":1,"changed":5},"preview":"作者：王垠","html":"<div class=\"diff-block diff-removed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">−</span><p>作者：王垠</p></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-changed diff-preformatted\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">±</span><div class=\"diff-inline\"><ins># </ins>Our teacher told us that there ______ no end to learning. A. was B. is * C. has D. had</div></div>\n<div class=\"diff-context\">Our teacher told us that there ______ no end to learning. A. was B. is * C. has D. had</div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-changed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">±</span><div class=\"diff-inline\">最有意思的是改错题。因为改错题是一个英语段落，某些行有错，但每行最多只能有一个错。所以我的设计是，在普通的段落里插入这样的记号：<del> This is an |extraordinary|extrordinary| sentence...</del></div></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-changed diff-preformatted\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">±</span><div class=\"diff-inline\"><del>用以“引入错误”。左边是正确的方式，右边是错误的。这里使用</del><ins>This is an</ins> |<del> 是因为这个符号不会在普通的英语文章里出现。</del><ins>extraordinary|extrordinary</ins>| <del>的左右两边都可以是空白，用以表示“插入”与“删除”。比如： I don&#x27;t know how to play |the|| piano</del><ins>sentence</ins>.<ins>..</ins></div></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-changed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">±</span><div class=\"diff-inline\"><ins>用以“引入错误”。左边是正确的方式，右边是错误的。</ins>这<del>样</del><ins>里使用 | 是因为这个符号不会在普通</ins>的<del>题目显</del><ins>英语文章里出现。| 的左右两边都可以是空白，用以表</ins>示<del>出来之后是这样</del><ins>“插入”与“删除”。比如</ins>：<del> I don&#x27;t know how to play piano.</del></div></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-changed diff-preformatted\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">±</span><div class=\"diff-inline\"><del>然后答案里会显示：</del><ins>I</ins> <del>在</del><ins>don&#x27;t know how to</ins> play <del>和</del><ins>|the||</ins> piano<del> 之间加 the</del><ins>.</ins></div></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-added\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span><p>这样的题目显示出来之后是这样：</p></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-added\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span><pre><code>I don't know how to play piano.\n</code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-added\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span><p>然后答案里会显示：</p></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-added\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span><pre><code>在 play 和 piano 之间加 the\n</code></pre></div>"},"blog-cn_2013_04_14_standard-exam-language_20140701.html":{"from":"blog-cn_2013_04_14_standard-exam-language_20130418.html","to":"blog-cn_2013_04_14_standard-exam-language_20140701.html","from_date":"2013-04-18","to_date":"2014-07-01","counts":{"added":1,"removed":0,"changed":0},"preview":"（王垠 yinwang.org 版权所有，未经许可，请勿转载）","html":"<div class=\"diff-block diff-added\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span><p>（王垠 yinwang.org 版权所有，未经许可，请勿转载）</p></div>"},"blog-cn_2013_04_14_standard-exam-language_20140804.html":{"from":"blog-cn_2013_04_14_standard-exam-language_20140701.html","to":"blog-cn_2013_04_14_standard-exam-language_20140804.html","from_date":"2014-07-01","to_date":"2014-08-04","counts":{"added":0,"removed":0,"changed":0},"preview":"","html":"<p class=\"diff-empty\">两个版本的正文没有可见差异。</p>"},"blog-cn_2013_04_14_standard-exam-language_20171025.html":{"from":"blog-cn_2013_04_14_standard-exam-language_20140804.html","to":"blog-cn_2013_04_14_standard-exam-language_20171025.html","from_date":"2014-08-04","to_date":"2017-10-25","counts":{"added":0,"removed":4,"changed":6},"preview":"作者：王垠","html":"<div class=\"diff-block diff-changed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">±</span><div class=\"diff-inline\"><del>（</del><ins>作者：</ins>王垠<del> 